## Tutorial application

```{r}
w <- map_data('world')
icj <- map_data("world",
                region = c("India", 'China', "Japan"))
ggplot(icj, aes(x=long,y=lat, group=group, fill=region))+
  geom_polygon(color='black')+
  coord_map("polyconic")+
  labs(
    title = "World map"
  )
```

